t_hardware-tableList pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Basic Information</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile pct_hardware-tableList\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Shell Material</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span>ABS</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Device  Operating Temperature</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span> -10°C to 60°C</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Temperature Measurement Range</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span>-50°C to 70℃</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Temperature Accuracy</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span>±1℃</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Display Screen</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span><span></span><span>LCD</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span>Display Operating Temperature</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span>-5°C to 50°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Humidity Measurement Range</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span><span></span><span>20% to 90%</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Humidity Accuracy</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span><span></span><span> ±5%</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 --></div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 -->\n<style>\n    .pct_productFeatureList {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: flex-start;\n        align-items: center;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        column-gap: 50px;\n        row-gap: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .pct_productFeatureList li {\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    @media (min-width: 640px) {\n        .pct_productFeatureList {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            column-gap: 50px;\n            row-gap: 0px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Small, durable, and portable</span>       |        <span>Monitor the temperature and humidity values</span>       |      <span></span><span></span><span>Fast response time,with a measurement cycle of 10 seconds</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>       Rated voltage is DC 1.5V (1x LR44 button cell battery)</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Considerations</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C7ACd0kGbo31IjxVolmca9l6nTf\" data-list=\"bullet\">This thermometer and hygrometer only displays temperature in Celsius (°C) and not in Fahrenheit (°F).</li>\n<li>If you need a thermometer that can switch between Celsius and Fahrenheit, consider our <strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"../../../products/circular-embedded-electronic-digital-thermometer-hygrometer-1pcs-xf001?skr=yes\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Circular Thermometer Hygrometer</a>.</span></strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">)</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoJqddxgJoenInxxBbUcA3pznoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">The device is rated for use in ambient temperatures from -10°C to 60°C, but the display operates reliably only between -5°C and 50°C. Using the device outside this display temperature range may cause slow response, screen lag, or other visual anomalies. </li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoJqddxgJoenInxxBbUcA3pznoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Avoid prolonged use or storage in extreme temperatures. Extended exposure to -10°C or below may cause moisture-sensitive components to freeze and sustain permanent damage. Similarly, continuous operation at 60°C or above can lead to gradual screen dimming, eventual blackouts, and potential damage to heat-sensitive parts. For optimal performance and longevity, avoid prolonged use in extreme temperatures.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "Small, durable, and portable | Monitor the temperature and humidity values | Fast response time,with a measurement cycle of 10 seconds\n\nRated voltage is DC 1.5V (1x LR44 button cell battery)\n\nThis thermometer and hygrometer only displays temperature in Celsius (°C) and not in Fahrenheit (°F).\n\nIf you need a thermometer that can switch between Celsius and Fahrenheit, consider our Circular Thermometer Hygrometer. )\n\nThe device is rated for use in ambient temperatures from -10°C to 60°C, but the display operates reliably only between -5°C and 50°C. Using the device outside this display temperature range may cause slow response, screen lag, or other visual anomalies.\n\nAvoid prolonged use or storage in extreme temperatures. Extended exposure to -10°C or below may cause moisture-sensitive components to freeze and sustain permanent damage. Similarly, continuous operation at 60°C or above can lead to gradual screen dimming, eventual blackouts, and potential damage to heat-sensitive parts. For optimal performance and longevity, avoid prolonged use in extreme temperatures.",
